# Project: External_Data_Manager

Standalone orchestrator for external data pipelines (Qualtrics V1A first).

## Conventions
- V8 runtime; JSDoc on public functions.
- Logger.log prefixed with function name.
- No hardcoded Drive folder IDs, spreadsheet IDs, or script IDs — Script Properties only.
- V1A: no Drive processing, no triggers, no DM workbook writes.

## File layout
- Source in `./src` (pushed via clasp when authorized).
- Local tests in `./test` (not pushed).
- `gas.config.json` holds deployment metadata when production exists.
